- `apiGet(url, params?)` - GET, returns raw Response
- `apiPost(url, data)` - POST, returns raw Response
- `apiPut(url, data)` - PUT, returns raw Response
- `apiDelete(url)` - DELETE, returns raw Response
- `apiGetJSON(url, params?)` - GET, returns parsed JSON (`.then(r => r.json())`)
- `apiPostJSON(url, data)` - POST, returns parsed JSON
- `apiPutJSON(url, data)` - PUT, returns parsed JSON

Key behaviors:
- Auto-injects `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from localStorage
- Auto-redirects to `/login` on 401 and throws error
- Always sets `Content-Type: application/json`

